=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>         outbound_data </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#008\">as</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">frame</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">m</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>         outbound_model </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> outbound_data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">which</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">outbound_data$store_nbr </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%</span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#660\">%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> input$store_nbr </span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> outbound_data$state_prov_code </span><span style=\"color:#660\">==</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> input$state</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        head</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">outbound_model</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input$obs</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span></code></pre></div></code></div>What I want to do is <i> </i>I want to hit the teradata table if i input the year value and then for that whole year I want to store it in R and then giving store_nbr and state input to that data so as to avoid large processing time for teradata each time I make changes to the input. <div><br></div><div>I have also tried to save query re